# Über mich
about_label: "About Me"
about_title_line1: "Clarity through"
about_title_em: "Experience."
about_p1: "As an executive coach and former VP at high-growth companies, I understand the challenges of leading in fast-paced, high-stakes environments firsthand."
about_p2: "My coaching combines deep operational and scaling expertise with systemic coaching methods. No textbook advice – a trusted, thinking partner at eye level."
about_p3: "I support you in sharpening your leadership presence, navigating complex organizational dynamics, and making confident decisions under uncertainty."
